OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar                
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny showers  
OL,6,Facross the north mostly dying out.     
OL,7,FOtherwise it will be a dry and cold    
OL,8,Fnight with clear skies and widespread  
OL,9,Fsharp frost. Light winds.              
OL,11,CSaturday:FAfter a frosty start it will 
OL,12,Fbe a mainly dry but cold day with      
OL,13,Fsunny periods. Chance of an odd shower 
OL,14,Faround far northern coasts.            
OL,16,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry     
OL,17,Fsunny spells on Sunday and Monday.     
OL,18,FRain perhaps arriving from the west on 
OL,19,FMonday evening and lingering through   
OL,20,FTuesday. Breezy in the west.           
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
